  "description": "Owen Reilly are delighted to present Temple Hall, a superb one-bedroom apartment set within this highly regarded and mature development. The property benefits from direct access to a generous balcony overlooking beautifully maintained communal grounds. Presented in excellent condition throughout, this impressive apartment provides bright, well-proportioned accommodation. The layout comprises a welcoming entrance hall and an exceptionally spacious living room linking through to a well appointed kitchen fitted with stylish units and having the benefit of a separate utility room,\n\nThe generous double bedroom features built-in wardrobes. The bathroom is finished to a high standard. A large walk in hot press is positioned off the entrance hall. The property further benefits from a designated car parking space.\n\nMore about the location...\n\nMilltown is a highly sought-after residential area in Dublin 6, renowned for its leafy surroundings, excellent amenities, and strong sense of community. Milltown Hall is located within Mount Saint Anne’s, one of Dublin’s most prestigious developments, celebrated for its beautifully landscaped grounds, mature planting, and exceptional build quality. Designed with both style and practicality in mind, the development offers a secure and tranquil setting just minutes from the city centre. Local highlights include weekend coffee and cake from Wilde & Green and scenic walks along the River Dodder. Ranelagh and Donnybrook villages are both within easy reach, offering an array of restaurants, cafés, shops, and services. The area is well served by a selection of schools and universities, while Mount Saint Anne’s enjoys private resident access to the LUAS Green Line at Milltown Station.\n\nFEATURES\n\nBeautifully presented, one-bedroom apartment.\nPrestigious development in the heart of Dublin 6.\nBeautifully presented, one bedroom apartment.\nExceptionally bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout.\nPrivate balcony overlooking communal grounds.\nDesignated car parking space included.\nGas Fired Central Heating.\nPrivate resident access to the LUAS Green Line at Milltown.\n",
